{"id": "EUVD-2026-103473", "enisaUuid": "c32e9614-e771-32d2-b919-ef2c562c480d", "description": "LodePNG through 20261006 contains a heap out-of-bounds read vulnerability in lodepng::getFilterTypesInterlaced() in lodepng_util.cpp that lacks bounds checks on decompressed IDAT data. Attackers can supply a crafted interlaced PNG declaring a raster larger than its IDAT stream to disclose adjacent heap memory or crash applications.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T11:38:39", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T02:15:36", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:L/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haindpwn/lodepng-getfiltertypesinterlaced-short-idat-oob-read", "https://github.com/lvandeve/lodepng/blob/e584a8490db1b76b81bf298c11c09d3b55d9c270/lodepng_util.cpp#L185-L203", "https://github.com/lvandeve/lodepng", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/lodepng-through-20261006-heap-out-of-bounds-read-via-getfiltertypesinterlaced"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-112020", "GHSA-245m-8wv4-4xg8"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.12, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "e7375d72-f349-371c-bd05-de5696151afc", "product": {"name": "lodepng", "vendor": {"name": "lvandeve"}}, "product_version": "0 \u226420261006"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "28469f07-7476-372c-9cf5-05cf5874ead0", "vendor": {"name": "lvandeve"}}], "isExploited": false}